<view class="result-page safe-bottom"><view class="result-header"><view class="back-button" bindtap="back">‹</view><text class="page-title">测评报告</text></view><view class="patient-strip card"><view class="avatar">{{patient.name ? patient.name.slice(0, 1) : '?'}}</view><view class="patient-name">{{patient.name || '当前患者'}}</view><view class="muted">{{assessment.createdAt}}</view></view><view class="score-hero"><view class="hero-code">{{assessment.scaleCode}}</view><view class="hero-score">{{scoreText}}<text>{{maximumText}}</text></view><view class="result-label {{abnormalClass}}">{{resultText}}</view></view><view class="card detail-card"><view class="section-title">测评详情</view><view class="detail-row"><text>评分状态</text><text>{{statusText}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>测评时长</text><text>{{assessment.durationSeconds || 0}} 秒</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>提交时间</text><text>{{assessment.submittedAt || assessment.createdAt}}</text></view></view><view class="card advice-card"><view class="section-title">温馨提示</view><view class="muted">本报告仅用于认知筛查参考，不能替代医生诊断。如结果异常或近期出现明显变化，建议携带报告前往正规医疗机构进一步评估。</view></view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="records">查看答题记录</button><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="back">返回量表列表</button></view>
